{
  "_about": "IGF M07 s10 'Hazardous zones 0, 1 and 2' - the hand-made m07_zones3d.js (1,561 lines) as a 3D-kit spec. 14 x 9 m of open deck, 1 unit = 1 m, deck top y = 0, the ship's side (+z) towards the viewer. The tank, the vent mast (outlet 6.5 m above the deck), the two enclosures, the 2-connection bunker manifold over its drip tray and the fuel pipe run are true size; the manifold valves are the kit's valve drawn at 0.45 (a DN200 pipe). Zone 0 = red skin on the tank, the pipes and the vent pipe; zone 1 = 3 m round the vent outlet and round each manifold valve + flange, and the amber fill of the two enclosures (their walls go glass); zone 2 = 4.5 m. The three lamps carry a green / red halo (a kit zone part). The original's Labels button and the legend chip are dropped (the kit's labels are always on; the zone names are the labels).",
